command-list: configure the commands tpm-rs does not implement as CC_NO

Classification: profile setting.

The implemented command set is a profile choice. Commands that tpm-rs does
not implement (tpm2-impl engine.rs SUPPORTED_COMMANDS) are configured CC_NO
so that both TPMs expose the same command set (TPM_CAP_COMMANDS,
TPM_PT_TOTAL_COMMANDS, TPM_PT_LIBRARY_COMMANDS) and reject the same command
codes with TPM_RC_COMMAND_CODE.

